@startuml webui_telemetry_flow
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #0E131F
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ArrowColor #00C7FD
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

box "Client Browser (Modern UI Engine)" #141B2D
participant "Browser DOM" as DOM
participant "HardwareTelemetryPoller" as Poller
participant "StreamTelemetryTracker" as Tracker
end box

box "Intel Arc Models Runner Daemon (:11434)" #1A2238
participant "FastAPI Gateway" as API
participant "DeviceDetector / Sysman" as Sysman
participant "Inference Worker" as Worker
end box

== 1. Asynchronous Silicon Heartbeat (Every 3000ms) ==
Poller -> API: GET /api/devices
activate API
API -> Sysman: detect_topology()
activate Sysman
Sysman --> API: DeviceSummary (GPU Name, USM, NPU Boost)
deactivate Sysman
API --> Poller: 200 OK (JSON Topology)
deactivate API
Poller -> DOM: Update #header-device-chip, #gpu-arch, #npu-gen

== 2. High-Resolution Streaming Chat Inference ==
DOM -> Tracker: start() [record t_dispatch via performance.now()]
DOM -> API: POST /api/chat (stream: true)
activate API
API -> Worker: dispatch inference
activate Worker
Worker --> API: SSE token stream chunk (first token)
API --> DOM: Chunk 1 payload
Tracker -> Tracker: onTokenChunk(1) [record t_first_token]
Tracker -> DOM: Render TTFT = (t_first_token - t_dispatch) ms

loop Token Generation
    Worker --> API: Next token chunk
    API --> DOM: Chunk N payload
    Tracker -> Tracker: onTokenChunk(N)
    Tracker -> DOM: Render Live TPS & Rolling TPOT (ms/t)
end

Worker --> API: Stream Finished (done: true)
deactivate Worker
API --> DOM: [DONE]
deactivate API
Tracker -> DOM: Finalize Generation Metrics & Update Engine Tag
@enduml
